  {
    "id": "fn.sort.no-grid-write",
    "description": "Occupied cells in the Excel spill zone do not produce #SPILL! — SORT returns the array",
    "notes": "Excel would #SPILL! if SORT at B1 needed B2. This model never writes a spill range; neighbors are irrelevant. Pick individual results with INDEX/SUM.",
    "tags": ["sort", "spill"],
    "quirks": ["array-eval-mode"],
    "formula": "=SORT(A1:A3)",
    "at": "Sheet1!B1",
    "expected": {
      "array": [
        [{ "number": 1 }],
        [{ "number": 2 }],
        [{ "number": 3 }]
      ]
    },
    "workbook": {
      "sheets": [{
        "name": "Sheet1",
        "cells": {
          "A1": { "number": 3 },
